e vast majority of orders at 204,429\n","*   **Mobile ranks second:** Smartphones generated 137,267 orders\n","*   **Organic Search:** The most effective acquisition channel, driving 124,425 orders\n","*   **Paid Search:** The second most important source with 94,341 orders"],"metadata":{"id":"8A1ZddNAHfWc"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["*   **Pre-holiday peak (December):** Weekly revenue grew rapidly starting in November, reaching its peak in mid-December (the week around December 14, 2020 – exceeding $3.5M in weekly revenue)\n","*   **Post-holiday slowdown:** A drop in sales is visible following Christmas and New Year's."],"metadata":{"id":"IG6uDascHInM"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["*   **Core markets:** Sales are heavily concentrated in North America and Europe\n","*   **Secondary regions:** Lower activity is visible in South Asia (India) and Australia"],"metadata":{"id":"GNWrRJh5HqS5"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["5.2. Strategic Recommendations"],"metadata":{"id":"AbITAc7dIJYK"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["\n","\n","*   **Optimize the Mobile Funnel:** Given that modern e-commerce typically skews heavily mobile, the gap between Desktop and Mobile here is substantial (204k vs. 137k)\n"],"metadata":{"id":"JPdKs_XMIOLc"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# 6. Pivot table"],"metadata":{"id":"hBr5VNhcd233"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["[Pivot tables](https://public.tableau.com/views/Portfolioproject1_17868868340750/Dashboard2?:language=en-US&publish=yes&:sid=&:redirect=auth&:display_count=n&:origin=viz_share_link)"],"metadata":{"id":"Wn6DhFVwNkgS"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 6.1. Count session by traffic channel and device"],"metadata":{"id":"uIcKKKTlBk89"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Description: Displays the distribution of user sessions across different traffic channels (e.g., Organic, Paid, Direct) segmented by device type (desktop, mobile, tablet) to highlight key acquisition channels."],"metadata":{"id":"ZpQ1KSH5zPw3"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Summary\n","\n","**Desktop drives the highest session volume:**\n","\n","\n","*   Organic Search on Desktop is the single largest traffic segment (72,622 sessions)\n","*   Paid Search (55,167) and Direct (47,825) on Desktop follow closely\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"LWxErng1J_WV"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 6.2. Top 10 Categories in Top 5 Countries"],"metadata":{"id":"EwLnlKgaBtKs"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Description: Ranks the top 10 best-selling product categories within the top 5 generating countries to analyze regional product demand and top revenue drivers."],"metadata":{"id":"4UD0SUOLAna_"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Summary\n","\n","\n","**United States is the massive primary market:** Revenue from the US vastly outpaces all other countries. Across every single market (US, UK, India, France, Canada), the top product categories follow the exact same ranking hierarchy:\n","*   Sofas & armchairs Absolute top seller\n","*   Chairs\n","*   Beds\n","*   Bookcases & shelving\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"mRlIpSw5JTaW"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 6.3. Monthly revenue by continent"],"metadata":{"id":"CSUu9SwGONSC"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Description: Tracks total revenue broken down by geographic continent across months, helping to identify regional sales performance and seasonal trends."],"metadata":{"id":"GEeW1yPzOSHN"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Summary\n","\n","*   **Americas dominates total volume:** Generated $6.85M in December (peak month)\n","\n","*   **Holiday seasonality pattern:** Across almost all continents (Americas, Asia, Europe, Oceania, Africa), revenue peaked in December before falling back in January to levels slightly below November"],"metadata":{"id":"ciouVWr0NOu7"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 6.4. RPS & Revenue by Tech Stack"],"metadata":{"id":"78J24s9AOUEv"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Description: Provides a detailed technical breakdown of performance metrics (Total Revenue, Total Sessions, and Revenue Per Session) segmented by device, operating system, and browser."],"metadata":{"id":"QsXS4aU5OYi6"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Summary\n","\n","**High-value tech stack outliers:**\n","\n","\n","*   Macintosh (browser): Exceptional RPS of $201.62 (though on a low sample size of 49 sessions)\n","\n","*   Windows (browser): High RPS of $161.63 across 790 sessions\n","\n","*   Macintosh + Edge (browser): High RPS of $321.03 across 34 sessions\n","\n","**Mainstream volume drivers maintain stable RPS:**\n","\n","*   Desktop Chrome users across OS environments consistently generate an RPS around $91.00 – $95.00\n","\n","*   Mobile iOS Safari users maintain a very steady RPS of $90.84\n","\n","*   Mobile Android Chrome users hold an RPS of $93.06\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"z8m1YKEwKd_W"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 6.5. Strategic Recommendations\n","\n","Focus inventory on core categories: Since Sofas & armchairs, Chairs, and Beds generate the bulk of total revenue globally, marketing campaigns and inventory planning should prioritize these top 3 categories"],"metadata":{"id":"ZW_l3sORN0_y"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# 7. Statistical analysis of the relationship"],"metadata":{"id":"P-z4wn26SMdB"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 7.1. Analyze sessions vs revenue correlation"],"metadata":{"id":"uLkXE0uaT4zB"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import pandas as pd\n","from scipy.stats import pearsonr, spearmanr\n","\n","# Create a new DataFrame grouped by order date and aggregate session counts and total revenue\n","df_daily = df.groupby('order_date').agg(cnt_session=('session_id', 'nunique'), total_revenue=('price', 'sum')).reset_index()\n","\n","# Calculate Pearson and Spearman correlation\n","pearson_corr = df_daily['cnt_session'].corr(df_daily['total_revenue'], method='pearson')\n","spearman_corr = df_daily['cnt_session'].corr(df_daily['total_revenue'], method='spearman')\n","\n","# Calculate p-value\n","print(f\"Test statistic and p-value: {pearsonr(df_daily['cnt_session'], df_daily['total_revenue'])}\")\n","print(f\"Test statistic and p-value: {spearmanr(df_daily['cnt_session'], df_daily['total_revenue'])}\")\n","\n","# Print Pearson and Spearman correlation\n","print(f\"Pearson Correlation: {pearson_corr}\")\n","print(f\"Spearman Correlation: {spearman_corr}\")\n","\n","# Create a plot\n","plt.figure(figsize=(10, 5))\n","sns.regplot(data=df_daily, x='cnt_session', y='total_revenue', scatter_kws={'alpha':0.6}, line_kws={'color':'red'})\n","plt.title('Correlation between sessions and total revenue')\n","plt.xlabel('Count of sessions (Daily)')\n","plt.ylabel('Total revenue (Daily)')\n","plt.grid(True, linestyle='--', alpha=0.5)\n","plt.show()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":556},"id":"R5h4h6Cucav-","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1788250731942,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":369,"user":{"displayName":"Bartosz Chołodziński","userId":"16595266025006234378"}},"outputId":"2c88de4a-9976-4bb4-83b0-a37e388f11e5"},"execution_count":16,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Test statistic and p-value: PearsonRResult(statistic=np.float64(0.7910809164540891), pvalue=np.float64(6.483532312080735e-21))\n","Test statistic and p-value: SignificanceResult(statistic=np.float64(0.8653062174563682), pvalue=np.float64(9.755923586156614e-29))\n","Pearson Correlation: 0.7910809164540887\n","Spearman Correlation: 0.8653062174563682\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1000x500 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Summary\n","\n","Direct Predictability: There is a strong, positive linear relationship between daily session count and total daily revenue. As the number of daily sessions increases, revenue grows proportionally and predictably along the red trend line.\n","\n","Predictable Scaling: On high-traffic days (5,000 to 7,000+ sessions), daily revenue scales smoothly up to $500k–$700k without noticeable diminishing returns.\n","\n","Strategic Recommendations\n","\n","Focus on Traffic Acquisition: Since revenue scales linearly with traffic, marketing investments aimed at increasing qualified session volume (SEO, SEM) are highly reliable drivers for revenue growth."],"metadata":{"id":"4ZflBkjFOTCY"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### 7.2. ANOVA Test for daily sales by continent in Top3"],"metadata":{"id":"AbdR4y9hTUp6"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import pandas as pd\n","from scipy import stats\n","\n","# Separate top 3 continents and create new dataframe\n","top3_continents = df.groupby('continent')['price'].sum().nlargest(3).index.tolist()\n","df_daily = df[df['continent'].isin(top3_continents)]\n","\n","# Data filtering and daily sales aggregation\n","daily_sales = df_daily.pivot_table(\n","    index='order_date',\n","    columns='continent',\n","    values='price',\n","    aggfunc='sum'\n",").fillna(0)\n","\n","# Extracting the data series for each continent\n","group1 = daily_sales[top3_continents[0]]\n","group2 = daily_sales[top3_continents[1]]\n","group3 = daily_sales[top3_continents[2]]\n","\n","# Performing ANOVA test\n","f_stat, p_value = stats.f_oneway(group1, group2, group3)\n","\n","print(f\"F-statistic: {f_stat}\")\n","print(f\"P-value: {p_value}\")\n","\n","# Interpretation\n","if p_value < 0.05:\n","    print(\"There is a statistically significant difference between the continents.\")\n","else:\n","    print(\"No statistically significant difference found between the continents.\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"BqLlAqymZc96","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1788254068724,"user_tz":-120,"elapsed":230,"user":{"displayName":"Bartosz Chołodziński","userId":"16595266025006234378"}},"outputId":"83be413f-65d0-46d6-ae19-b6ad3625bb23"},"execution_count":22,"outputs":[{"output_type":"s